.TH CRUNCH_EVENTFD 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_eventfd \- Linux x86-64 syscall 284
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B int crunch_eventfd(unsigned int value);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the original eventfd syscall without flags.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR eventfd (2)
